// A crater already in progress, and one open at the buggy's own column --
// the state count_down/next_col's crater-continuing branch and in_pit's/
// solid_col's/reset_ground's crater-column branch each need, none of which
// mb_setup alone ever reaches (a fresh game starts with crater_left 0 and
// solid ground everywhere).
crater_setup() {
  mb_setup();
